        <activityName xml:lang="en">xx Electricity, at cogen 160kWe lambda=1, allocation price</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: xx Electricity, at cogen 160kWe lambda=1, allocation price
The multioutput-process 'natural gas, burned in cogen 160kWe lambda=1, allocation price' delivers the coproducts 'heat, at cogen 160kWe lambda=1, allocation price' and 'electricity, at cogen 160kWe lambda=1, allocation price'.;
UUID: 0157c0eb-78df-380d-aca7-25bc33ed6f74
The module includes fuel input, infrastructure, emissions to air, and substances needed for operation.
Location: Could be used for central European conditions.
Technology: Average technology available on market.
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: Literature. Manufacturer information. 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_0157c0eb-78df-380d-aca7-25bc33ed6f74.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
